<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-03-18T14:51:04+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>A simple, whitespace theme for academics. Based on [*folio](https://github.com/bogoli/-folio) design. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">💰 New research **grant** from **NRF** (핵심-유형B)!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/new-research-grant-from-nrf/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="💰 New research **grant** from **NRF** (핵심-유형B)!"/><published>2026-03-13T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-03-13T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/new-research-grant-from-nrf</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/new-research-grant-from-nrf/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-20230301-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-20230301-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-20230301-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-20230301-1.png" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>We received a new research grant (핵심-유형B) from National Research Foundation of Korea!</p> <p>Title: Everyday Object as an Agent: XR-based Interaction Framework for Tangible Agent Ecosystem</p> <p>Period: 26.03 ~ 31.02</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[New research grant from NRF (핵심-유형B)!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">📄 Four posters **accepted** to **ACM** **CHI** 2026!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/four-posters-accepted-to-acm-chi-2026/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="📄 Four posters **accepted** to **ACM** **CHI** 2026!"/><published>2026-03-07T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-03-07T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/four-posters-accepted-to-acm-chi-2026</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/four-posters-accepted-to-acm-chi-2026/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-20260124-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-20260124-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-20260124-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-20260124-1.png" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Our papers were accepted to ACM CHI 2026 as Posters!</p> <ul> <li> <p>“Investigating the Impact of Lying Postures on Mixed Reality Interaction” by Yujin Jeong, Jiwon Lee, Jae-Yeop Jeong, Euna Byun, HyeokJu Ko</p> </li> <li> <p>“How Video See-Through MR Affects Pointing on Physical Devices: From Smartphones to Large Monitors” by Yujin Jeong, Jae-Yeop Jeong, HyeokJu Ko</p> </li> <li> <p>“Knight Path: Supporting Player Sense-making in Game Narratives via Visual Scaffolding and Spoiler-Aware AI” by Euna Byun, Jae-Yeop Jeong, Yewon Min</p> </li> <li> <p>“Reading the Mood Behind Words: Integrating Prosody-Derived Emotional Context into Socially Responsive VR Agents” Cowork with SangYeop Jeong, YeongSeo Na, Seung Gyu Jeong, Seoung-Eun Kim</p> </li> </ul> <p>Congratulations to all authors!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Four posters accepted to ACM CHI 2026!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">📄 Two papers **accepted** to **ACM** **CHI** 2026!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/two-papers-accepted-to-acm-chi-2026/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="📄 Two papers **accepted** to **ACM** **CHI** 2026!"/><published>2026-01-24T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-01-24T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/two-papers-accepted-to-acm-chi-2026</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2026/two-papers-accepted-to-acm-chi-2026/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-20260124-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-20260124-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-20260124-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-20260124-1.png" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Our papers were accepted to ACM CHI 2026 as Full Papers!</p> <ul> <li> <p>“Exploring Interface Design of MR Translation System for Everyday Interaction” by Jiyeon Oh</p> </li> <li> <p>“Steering through a Dynamically Varying Path” by Jae-Yeop Jeong</p> </li> </ul>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Two papers accepted to ACM CHI 2026!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">🧑‍🎓 Jiseop and Byeonghwa joined the lab!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/Jisep-Byeonghwa-joined-the-lab/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="🧑‍🎓 Jiseop and Byeonghwa joined the lab!"/><published>2025-12-22T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-12-22T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/Jisep-Byeonghwa-joined-the-lab</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/Jisep-Byeonghwa-joined-the-lab/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-2025-12-22-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-2025-12-22-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-2025-12-22-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-2025-12-22-1.jpg" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Jiseop Lee (ITM Division) and Byeonghwa Yu (ITM Division) joined IXLAB as Undergraduate Students.</p> <p>Welcome!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Jiseop and Byeonghwa joined the lab!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">📄 Our paper **accepted** to IJHCS! (IF:5.1, 8.3%)</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/our-paper-accepted-to-ijhcs-copy/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="📄 Our paper **accepted** to IJHCS! (IF:5.1, 8.3%)"/><published>2025-11-30T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-11-30T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/our-paper-accepted-to-ijhcs%20copy</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/our-paper-accepted-to-ijhcs-copy/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-2025-11-30-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-2025-11-30-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-2025-11-30-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-2025-11-30-1.jpg" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Our paper “SnapSound: Empowering Everyone to Customize Sound Experience with Generative AI” has been accepted to International Journal of Human-Computer Studies (SCI, IF:5.1 (8.3%)) Congratulations to the authors!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Our paper accepted to IJHCS! (IF:5.1, 8.3%)]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">📄 One paper **accepted** to **ISMAR** 2025 **Poster** track!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-ismar-2025-poster-track/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="📄 One paper **accepted** to **ISMAR** 2025 **Poster** track!"/><published>2025-09-05T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-09-05T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-ismar-2025-poster-track</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-ismar-2025-poster-track/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-20250905-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-20250905-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-20250905-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-20250905-1.png" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Our paper “Exploring Interface Design of Translation System for Enhanced Immersion and Usability in Mixed Reality” by Jiyeon Oh was accepted to 2025 ISMAR Poster track!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[One paper accepted to ISMAR 2025 Poster track!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">📄 One paper **accepted** to **UIST** 2025 **Poster** track!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-uist-2025-poster-track/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="📄 One paper **accepted** to **UIST** 2025 **Poster** track!"/><published>2025-08-05T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-08-05T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-uist-2025-poster-track</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-uist-2025-poster-track/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-20250805-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-20250805-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-20250805-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-20250805-1.png" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Our paper “Silent Yet Expressive: Toward Seamless VR Communication through Emotion-aware Silent Speech Interfaces” by Yewon Min, Jiyeon Oh, Jae-Yeop Jeong was accepted to 2025 UIST Poster tracK!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[One paper accepted to UIST 2025 Poster track!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">🏆 Received **Best Paper** **Award** for **IUI**2025 paper!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/received-best-paper-award-for-iui2025-paper/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="🏆 Received **Best Paper** **Award** for **IUI**2025 paper!"/><published>2025-04-18T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-04-18T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/received-best-paper-award-for-iui2025-paper</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/received-best-paper-award-for-iui2025-paper/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-2025-04-18-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-2025-04-18-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-2025-04-18-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-2025-04-18-1.png" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Our paper “A picture is worth a thousand words? Investigating the Impact of Image Aids in AR on Memory Recall for Everyday Tasks” by Elizaveta Lukianova and Jae-Yeop Jeong received “Best Paper Award” from IUI 2025!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Received Best Paper Award for IUI2025 paper!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">🏆 Received **Best Paper** **Honorable Mention** for **CHI**2025 paper!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/received-best-paper-honorable-mention-for-chi2025-paper/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="🏆 Received **Best Paper** **Honorable Mention** for **CHI**2025 paper!"/><published>2025-04-18T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-04-18T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/received-best-paper-honorable-mention-for-chi2025-paper</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/received-best-paper-honorable-mention-for-chi2025-paper/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/chihonor-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/chihonor-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/chihonor-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/chihonor.png" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Our paper “Understanding User Behavior in Window Selection using Dragging for Multiple Targets”  by Jae-Yeop Jeong received “Best Paper Honorable Mention” from CHI 2025!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Received Best Paper Honorable Mention for CHI2025 paper!]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">📄 One paper **accepted** to 2025 **CHI** **LBW**!</title><link href="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-2025-chi-lbw/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="📄 One paper **accepted** to 2025 **CHI** **LBW**!"/><published>2025-02-24T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-02-24T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-2025-chi-lbw</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://st-ixlab.github.io/blog/2025/one-paper-accepted-to-2025-chi-lbw/"><![CDATA[<div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/news-2025-02-24-1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/news-2025-02-24-1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/news-2025-02-24-1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/news-2025-02-24-1.png" class="rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <p>Our paper “Exploring Emotion Expression Through Silent Speech Interface in Public VR/MR: Effects of Automation on User Experience” by Yewon Min, Jiyeon Oh, Jae-Yeop Jeong was accepted to 2025 CHI LBW tracK!</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="news"/><category term="news"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[One paper accepted to 2025 CHI LBW!]]></summary></entry></feed>